{
  "description": "SLS 1.3 hard exclusions (stablecoins 1.6, fiat-pegged assets, leveraged tokens 1.7) applied by the registry sync, stored as EXCLUDED + exclusion_reason (migration 023), and kept out of the daily universe loop. Each mutation weakens one decision -- a list, the leveraged flag, the naming fallback's guard, the sync's ordering, the upsert, or the loop -- and names the test that must notice. Needs Docker for the Pg tests. Run from backend/: uv run python -m tests.support.mutation_battery tests/mutations/universe_exclusions.json",
